验（存储/DDR/系统优化方向优先）；具备基本沟通表达能力、团队意识与责任心。\n2、熟悉 Linux 内核子系统：存储方向掌握 eMMC/UFS 协议、块设备与掉电保护；DDR 方向掌握 DDR 时序、PHY 配置与压测；内存/温控/电源方向熟悉内存管理、Thermal framework、PM/Regulator/Runtime PM；系统稳定性方向掌握必备的稳定性分析方法论，日志分析能力；\n3、熟练使用 ftrace、perf、meminfo、slabinfo等调试工具，能看懂 panic 栈、dmesg 与内核日志，具备独立根因分析能力；会 shell/python 编写自动化压测脚本，掌握 git 版本管理。\n4、具备跨硬件、基带、测试团队的协同能力与问题复盘能力，文档输出规范。\n5、有高通/MTK/展锐智能模组平台、模组/PCBA/ODM 整机量产稳定性交付经验；有客户问题闭环经验；熟悉 Android/Linux 驱动、DTS 设备树、GKI 内核；有存储/系统稳定性/功耗/温控专项量产优化经验。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-16T11:28:01","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"88da7cc9-4b65-43d1-b3ba-c29e71f1f2be","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561324148,"PostDateInt":1794798797000,"PostDate":"2026-11-16T11:13:17","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00